e longtime  ghostbusters fans felt that the film was  somehow damaging to what came before and  a wave of social media vitriol followed  throughout its development and up  through the film's release jason reitman  had nothing to do with that film though  his father was credited as a producer  jason reitman's new ghostbusters project  is a direct sequel to the original two  films so it will ignore the reboot that  fact plus ghostbusters 2016 star leslie  jones's anger at being excluded from  future films meant reitman caught flack  in february 2019 when he said that he  was making an effort to quote hand the  movie back to the fans many took his  comments as an insult to the 2016 movie  and its cast led by women just days  later after hearing the response his  comments received reitman clarified his  remarks noting he had quote nothing but  admiration for the reboot and calling it  an amazing movie the director later said  that ghostbusters afterlife was actually  inspired by the 2016 film in a way he  told sfx magazine i think that the  remake proved at least to me the idea  that the ghostbusters could be anyone  and i expanded on this idea with  afterlife while always focusing on the  family aspect and the history that was  created by the original films  are you the ghostbusters actually we're  the conductors of them  yes we're the ghostbusters  dan aykroyd in particular has been  trying to get the ghostbusters series  back on the big screen years before the  2016 reboot and it does seem that the  door is now open to some ideas  those ideas apparently include a prequel  called ghostbusters high which acroid  has written as a potential feature film  that could launch a tv series  chronicling how peter rey and egon first  met as teenagers in 1969 in new jersey  though he was excited about the idea  aykroyd also cautioned that ghostbusters  high is just one of a number of ideas he  and the reitmans are exploring aykroyd  explained to the canadian press we have  other stuff after the jason reitman  helmed movie we have at least one or two  other concepts for the ghostbusters and  then we'll look at doing the prequel  which will be a perfect button on all  we've done up to that point in other  words if you like ghostbusters just keep  an eye out because we seem to be far  from finished with the franchise  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos but  your favorite movie franchises are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]
 

